  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#m]\n[C#]\n[F#m]\n[D7]\n[G]\n[A7]\n[D]\n[F#m]\n[G]\n[A7]\n[D]\nLove is real,\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F#m]\n[C#]real is love\n[F#m]\n[D7]Love is feel-\n[G]ing,\n[A7]feeling love\n[D]\n[F#m]Love is want-\n[Em7]ing\n[A7]to be loved\n[D]\nLove is touch,\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F#m]\n[C#]touch is love\n[F#m]\n[D7]Love is reach-\n[G]ing,\n[A7]reaching love\n[D]\n[F#m]Love is ask-\n[Em7]ing\n[A7]to be loved\n[D]\nLove is you\n\n[Bridge]\n[F]\n[G]You and me\n[D]\nLove is know\n[Em7]ing\n[G]we can be\n[D]\nLove is free,\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F#m]\n[C#]free is love\n[F#m]\n[D7]Love is li-\n[G]ving,\n[A7]living love\n[D]\n[F#m]Love is need-\n[Em7]ing\n[A7]to be loved\n[D]\n\n[Outro]\n[F#m]\n[C#]\n[F#m]\n[D7]\n[G]\n[A7]\n[D]\n[F#m]\n[G]\n[A7]\n[D]",
